@startuml sequencia-autenticacao
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
title Sequência — autenticação e sessão (Firebase Auth)

actor "Profissional\nde saúde" as P
participant "Login /\nRegister" as UI
participant "AuthContext" as Auth
participant "Firebase Auth" as FA
participant "Backend\n(Robyn)" as B
database "Firestore" as DB

== Inicialização ==
Auth -> FA : onAuthStateChanged()
alt sessão existente
  FA --> Auth : User
  Auth --> UI : user autenticado → /home
else sem sessão
  FA --> Auth : null
  Auth --> UI : exibe Splash → Login
end

== Login e-mail ==
P -> UI : e-mail + senha
opt Manter-me conectado (web)
  UI -> FA : setPersistence(\nbrowserLocal | browserSession)
end
UI -> Auth : login(email, password)
Auth -> FA : signInWithEmailAndPassword()
FA --> Auth : User
Auth --> UI : navigate(/home)

== Login Google ==
P -> UI : Continuar com Google
UI -> Auth : loginWithGoogle()
alt Capacitor nativo
  Auth -> FA : Capacitor signInWithGoogle\n+ signInWithCredential
else Web
  Auth -> FA : signInWithPopup(googleProvider)
end
FA --> Auth : User
UI -> B : POST /users/consent/\n(sync perfil)
B -> DB : upsert users/{uid}
UI --> P : /home

== Registro ==
P -> UI : Criar conta (e-mail/senha)
UI -> Auth : register(email, password)
Auth -> FA : createUserWithEmailAndPassword()
FA --> Auth : User
UI --> P : /home
note right of UI
  Sync Firestore do registro e-mail
  ocorre depois, em saveAnalysis
  (ensureUserSynced).
end note

== Logout ==
P -> UI : Drawer → Sair
UI -> Auth : logout()
Auth -> FA : signOut()
Auth --> UI : navigate(/login)

@enduml
